        "func": "// Merutekan state fisik LED (pens/klp4/ruangN/lampM/state) ke 8 Switch UI\nconst parts = msg.topic.split('/');\nconst key = parts[2] + '_' + parts[3]; // misal: ruang1_lamp1\nconst val = String(msg.payload).trim();\nconst out = { payload: val };\n\nconst map = [\n    'ruang1_lamp1', 'ruang1_lamp2',\n    'ruang2_lamp1', 'ruang2_lamp2',\n    'ruang3_lamp1', 'ruang3_lamp2',\n    'ruang4_lamp1', 'ruang4_lamp2'\n];\nconst res = [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null];\nconst idx = map.indexOf(key);\nif (idx !== -1) res[idx] = out;\nreturn res;",
